---
// Section: Industry Benchmark Research (A voicemail is not a booked job)
---

<section id="research" class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-[#F8FAFC] border-b border-sky-blue/60 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Centered) -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-light-blue border border-sky-blue text-xs font-semibold text-deep-green uppercase tracking-wider font-mono mb-4">
        Industry Benchmark Research
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-ink-deep tracking-tight mb-4 font-heading">
        A voicemail is not a booked job.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">
        When nobody picks up, callers do not wait for you. In one 2025 survey of 1,000 US consumers, 82% said they would call a competitor if a business did not answer, and 21% said they call another business immediately. The company that answers first gets the conversation. Talkera Desk answers, books the job into your calendar or CRM, and texts your crew.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Research Stat Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-10">
      
      <!-- Pillar 1: 52% (Deep Green) -->
      <div class="bg-deep-green text-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between items-center text-center min-h-[320px] shadow-tactile relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
        <div class="absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 w-32 h-32 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold font-heading text-lime-accent tracking-tighter tabular mb-3">
            52%
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-white mb-2 leading-snug">
            Callers who spoke with a person
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Across 70 million+ home service and restoration calls, nearly half of all callers never reach anyone.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full pt-6 border-t border-white/10 mt-6 flex justify-center">
          <a
            href="https://www.invoca.com/reports/the-invoca-home-services-lead-conversion-benchmarks-report-2026"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs text-lime-accent hover:underline flex items-center justify-center gap-1 font-mono"
          >
            <span>Invoca Report (2026)</span>
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2: 82% (Brand Green) -->
      <div class="bg-brand-green text-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between items-center text-center min-h-[320px] shadow-tactile relative overflow-hidden group hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
        <div class="absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 w-32 h-32 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold font-heading text-white tracking-tighter tabular mb-3">
            82%
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-white mb-2 leading-snug">
            Call a competitor if you don't answer
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-100 leading-relaxed">
            Homeowners facing a burst pipe, broken heater, or sewage backup move straight down search results until someone answers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full pt-6 border-t border-white/20 mt-6 flex justify-center">
          <a
            href="https://www.callrail.com/blog/missed-calls-cost-businesses-more-than-ever"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs text-white underline hover:text-lime-accent flex items-center justify-center gap-1 font-mono"
          >
            <span>CallRail Survey (2025)</span>
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3: 21% (Light Blue) -->
      <div class="bg-light-blue text-ink rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between items-center text-center min-h-[320px] border border-sky-blue shadow-tactile group hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold font-heading text-deep-green tracking-tighter tabular mb-3">
            21%
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-ink-deep mb-2 leading-snug">
            Immediately dial another contractor
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
            One in five callers will not even wait 30 seconds for a callback. They immediately redial the next competitor.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full pt-6 border-t border-sky-blue mt-6 flex justify-center">
          <a
            href="https://www.callrail.com/blog/missed-calls-cost-businesses-more-than-ever"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-xs text-deep-green hover:underline flex items-center justify-center gap-1 font-mono font-semibold"
          >
            <span>CallRail Survey (2025)</span>
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Required Disclaimer Under Cards -->
    <p class="text-xs text-slate text-center font-mono max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Both companies sell call tools. These are their findings, not promises from us. Calculate your business's numbers below.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
